Message-ID: <Pine.OSX.4.64.0804232142230.9832@pol-w87351t4x8a.Princeton.EDU>

Hi,
   Yes, that's correct. In particular, you do not want to control for 
post-treatment variables.  This means that depending on the treatment 
variable the model specification will be different. See Section 6.1 of our 
PA paper.
Kosuke

